# Start a task with a suggested project, then pause, resume, and add time.
Output docs/demo/start.gif
Source docs/demo/settings.tape
Source docs/demo/launch.tape

Sleep 1s
Type "uni"
Sleep 1s
Tab
Sleep 600ms
Tab
Type "Write the README"
Sleep 400ms
Tab
Type "25m"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 3.5s
Type "p"
Sleep 2.5s
Type "p"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "d"
Sleep 600ms
Type "10m"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Hide
Ctrl+C
